I propose a new type of shop for nethack: The cheese shop.
-There can only be one cheese shop per game
-All cheese shop shopkeepers are named Mr Wensleydale.
-Cheese shop shopkeepers are only interested in buying cheese (which
exists in [s], but I don't think it does in vanilla.). In all other
ways they would be just like any other shopkeepers. (So no special code
needed for the shopkeep, just for the shop itself).
-All cheese shops are, of course, completely devoid of dairy products
(or indeed any stock at all). It's just a big empty room with a
shopkeeper standing in it. Cheese shops stored in bones files would
have to have any cheesy stuff removed from stock when the file is
loaded.
-The shopkeeper may keep a cat (peaceful to the player).

You could add some YAFMs when #chatting to the shopkeep but that seems
a little superfluous to me, so maybe shooting him dead with a firearm
in [s] could give the message "What a senseless waste of human life."

